engineers try to pluck a hole

00:19:30.773 --> 00:19:34.170
more than 5,000 feet deep in the ocean.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:39.150
- Because there's never been a
leak this size at this depth,

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:42.892
